# Cloud / Local Agent Boundary

- Prefer local Agent for control-plane, secrets, and Windows environment-variable work.
- Use `/in-cloud` only for isolated parallel work that does not need local home hooks or live machine secrets.
- Cloud agents load project `.cursor/hooks.json` only — not `~/.cursor/hooks.json`.
- Keep IDE tools on `agentcore-gateway`; never add direct OpenRouter or Swarm MCP for cloud convenience.
- Do not modify Swarm product code from AgentCore cloud sessions.
